314
00:23:55.294 --> 00:24:00.862
Author to Author: resolve every comment - changed, declined with reason, or open question.

315
00:24:01.142 --> 00:24:02.187
Author to Guild:

316
00:24:02.467 --> 00:24:05.881
30-min session only for unresolved disagreements.

317
00:24:06.161 --> 00:24:09.062
