318
00:24:09.342 --> 00:24:13.801
Author to Author: status Approved, ADRs merged, model updated.

319
00:24:17.651 --> 00:24:21.128
Sequence: failure path, how drift is caught after approval.

320
00:24:21.408 --> 00:24:24.203
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

321
00:24:24.483 --> 00:24:25.571
Dev to CI:

322
