389
00:29:56.531 --> 00:30:04.872
The linter checks required sections, adjectives-without-numbers, the number of listed alternatives, rollout substance, and a decision record.

390
00:30:06.222 --> 00:30:09.785
Here is the MARKDOWN code, docs/bad_design.md.

391
00:30:10.065 --> 00:30:13.585
