392
00:30:13.865 --> 00:30:14.739
Design:

393
00:30:15.019 --> 00:30:16.321
New Checkout Service.

394
00:30:16.601 --> 00:30:17.518
Background.

395
00:30:17.798 --> 00:30:18.993
Proposed Design.

396
00:30:21.843 --> 00:30:24.829
