432
00:33:26.310 --> 00:33:30.065
DIAGRAMS AS CODE from ONE MODEL (the Structurizr idea).

433
00:33:30.345 --> 00:33:39.134
Hand-drawn diagrams drift apart: the context diagram says one. thing, the container diagram another, and neither matches production.

434
00:33:39.414 --> 00:33:42.251
Instead we define the architecture ONCE as a.

435
00:33:45.101 --> 00:33:46.019
On screen:

436
00:33:46.299 --> 00:33:52.699
One architecture model, then every C4 view is generated from it, and the model can be. validated.

437
00:33:52.979 --> 00:33:53.725
Model:

438
00:33:54.005 --> 00:34:19.200
PERSON=2, SYSTEM=1, EXTERNAL=2, CONTAINER=5, DATABASE=2, QUEUE=1, 11. relationships. = Generated C4 Level 1, System Context (containers collapsed into their system) =. flowchart LR. customer(Customer). shopGrocery Platform. rider(Delivery rider). razorpayRazorpay - external. smsSMS gateway - external.

439
00:34:19.480 --> 00:34:20.995
