440
00:34:23.845 --> 00:34:24.698
Reading it:

441
00:34:24.978 --> 00:34:34.279
The context view collapses containers into their system automatically, internal arrows disappear, external ones are re-attached to Grocery Platform.

442
00:34:34.559 --> 00:34:44.714
